OL,3,GNEWSAVandals target heritage railway   
OL,4,Aline                                   
OL,6,FA train on a heritage railway in North 
OL,7,FYorkshire has been targeted by vandals,
OL,8,Fits manager said.                      
OL,10,FVandals are thought to have trespassed 
OL,11,Fon railway tracks on the Wensleydale   
OL,12,FRailway line on Thursday night and     
OL,13,Fgraffitied a 1980s Pacer, which was    
OL,14,Fparked near Bedale.                    
OL,16,FWhile the damage was painted over by   
OL,17,Fthe railway's operations staff the     
OL,18,Ffollowing day, the incident was        
OL,19,Fdescribed as "incredibly frustrating"  
OL,20,Fand "so dangerous".                    
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
