OL,3,GNEWSAVandals target heritage railway   
OL,4,Aline                                   
OL,6,FNick Keegan, marketing and fundraising 
OL,7,Fmanager, said: "We're very busy running
OL,8,Four Christmas train services, our Polar
OL,9,FExpress services, and really the last  
OL,10,Fthing our small team of staff and      
OL,11,Fvolunteers need is to have to deal with
OL,12,Fthis sort of issue."                   
